    rdfs:comment "A five-stage LPBF workflow that transforms layer-wise sensing data into identified process, melt-pool, powder/recoating, defect, and quality states; inferred failure causes and responses; evaluated thermal, defect, and quality indicators; and adaptive build or scan-parameter management actions."@en ;
    rdfs:subClassOf lpbf:CyberAsset .

